# Every text file is checked out with LF, on Windows too: tests compare generated files byte for
# byte, and files built into the program must be the same on every system. Git for Windows
# otherwise turns them into CRLF (core.autocrlf=true is its default).
* text=auto eol=lf

# These run on Linux and macOS whatever machine they were checked out on.
*.sh text eol=lf
packaging/macos/scripts/** text eol=lf
packaging/linux/** text eol=lf
packaging/freebsd/** text eol=lf
packaging/install.sh text eol=lf
scripts/ffmpeg.lock text eol=lf
